    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "We are delighted to present No. 5 O'Carolan Road to the market. Beautifully refurbished in 2023, this exceptional two-bedroom mid-terraced home is situated in one of the most sought-after residential pockets of Dublin 8. \r\n\r\nLovingly maintained by its current owners, the property combines contemporary finishes with attractive original features and benefits from a strong B3 energy rating. This turnkey property is ready to welcome its next chapter.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, a welcoming hallway with stylish herringbone laminate flooring and convenient under-\r\nstairs storage sets the tone for the home.\r\n\r\nThe elegant herringbone flooring continues into a bright and spacious open-plan living, dining and kitchen area, providing the perfect setting for everyday living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nTo the front, a cosy seating and TV area creates an inviting space in which to relax around the solid-fuel stove. The contemporary kitchen runs along one wall and includes fitted cabinetry, an induction hob, double oven and integrated dishwasher. This leaves a generous dining area overlooking the rear courtyard.\r\n\r\nCompleting the ground floor to the rear, the original galley kitchen now accommodates a well-appointed utility and pantry with vaulted ceiling, roof light and excellent storage, leading to a stylish ground-floor WC.\r\n\r\nUpstairs are two well-proportioned double bedrooms, both retaining original cast-iron fireplaces. The principal bedroom also features original timber flooring,  built-in wardrobes and fitted shelving. Completing the first floor is a beautifully finished main bathroom with a large glazed shower cubicle, heated towel rail and tiled flooring.\r\n\r\nOutside, the private rear courtyard garden has been thoughtfully designed for low-maintenance use, with porcelain paving, contemporary slatted timber panelling and a raised planter with a mature olive tree.\r\nTo the front is a railed city garden with secure bicycle storage, with on-street parking available.\r\nThe location is both peaceful and exceptionally convenient. \r\n\r\nSet within the peaceful and historic Tenters neighbourhood, O’Carolan Road combines a strong sense of community  just off the South Circular Road. The area is exceptionally well served, with Marlowe & Co., The Fumbally, Weaver Park and Oscar Square nearby, alongside numerous shops, schools, cafés and restaurants. St Stephen’s Green and Christchurch are just a 15–20 minute stroll away, served by Dublin Bus and with both Luas lines also within easy reach."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hallway \t\t3.25m * 1.24m\r\nLaminate herring bone wood floor. Alarm panel. Understairs storage.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining room\t4.9m * 3.15m\r\nLaminate herring bone wood floor. Solid fuel stove. Fully fitted floor and wall units. Stainless steel sink unit. Integrated whirlpool dishwasher. Whirlpool double oven. Bosch induction hob. Hoover extractor fan.\r\n\r\nLiving room\t\t3.25m * 3.1m\r\nLaminate herring bone floor. TV point.\r\n\r\nUtility Room\t\t3.44m * 1.79m\r\nStainless steel sink unit. Laminate herring bone wood floor. Fully fitted floor units. Vaulted ceiling. Velux windows. Plumbed for washing machine and dryer.\r\n\r\nWC\t\t\t1.88m * 1.51m\r\nLaminate herring bone wood floor. WC. Wash hand basin. Ideal gas boiler.\r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\nLanding\t\t\t2.48m * .86m\r\nAttic access.\r\n\r\nBedroom \t\t4.08m * 3.17m\r\nOriginal wood floor. Built in wardrobes. Original cast iron fireplace. Fitted shelving.\r\n\r\nBedroom \t\t3.31m * 3m\r\nOriginal cast iron fireplace. Double room. Shelving.\r\n\r\nBathroom\t\t2.31m * 1.89m\r\nTiled floor. Wash hand basin. WC. Large, glazed shower cubicle. Extractor fan. Heated towel rail.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nFront\r\nRailed front garden. Bike storage. Paving raised bed. Parking.\r\n\r\nRear\t\t\t5.31m * 2.6m\r\nPorcelain paving. Raised planter with Olive tree. Slatted wood panelling. Outdoor heater."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tBright city home lovingly maintained by the current owners with a contemporary finish\r\n•\tFully upgraded in 2023 incl. full electrical upgrade, insulation, heating and pumped water system\r\n•\t786sq ft/ 73.04sqm\r\n•\tGas-fired central heating\r\n•\tOn-street parking\r\n•\tSeparate utility / pantry\r\n•\tGround-floor WC\r\n•\tSuperb location within a short walk from Dublin city centre\r\n•\tClose to numerous schools, shops, restaurants, gyms and colleges\r\n•\tServed by Dublin bus"
      },
